<title>JAPAN: Kokusai System -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kokusai System -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.23		vs	    2.14</p>
<p> Operating    loss 79    million	  vs	  prft 6 million</p>
<p> Current	loss 49    million	  vs	 prft 26 million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 67    million	  vs	 prft 11 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 9.68 yen	  vs     prft 1.57 yen</p>
<p> Shares		7 million	  vs	   7 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Kokusai System Co Ltd is a software developer.</p>
</text>
